===============================================================================
Dictionary data
===============================================================================

The lexicon shipped in this product (app/src/main/assets/lexicon.tsv) is
compiled from datasets published by the ChhoeTaigi project
(ChhoeTaigi 找台語：台語字詞資料庫, part of 台文雞絲麵 Tâibûn Kesimī):
  https://github.com/ChhoeTaigi/ChhoeTaigiDatabase
  https://chhoe.taigi.info/

The lexicon is a MODIFIED version of these datasets: romanizations were
re-parsed and normalized to numeric-tone Tâi-lô, Hàn-lô forms were cleaned of
annotations, entries without usable romanization or Hàn-lô were dropped, and
the datasets were merged and de-duplicated with derived ranking weights, by
tools/dictbuilder in this repository.

